From: AzediZ <145237384+AzediZ@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 17:21:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 84/91] Incursion system penalties

Vanguard, Assault and Headquarters systems now get the Crucible penalties:
shield and armour resists and turret, missile, drone and smartbomb damage
are down 10/25/50% at full Sansha influence, scaling down to nothing at
zero. The staging system has none. Cynos are jammed (covert cynos still
work) and CONCORD bounties are halved everywhere in the constellation.

The incursion beacon types use OffensiveDefensiveReduction, which has no
expression, so it is expanded to the effects its description lists. The
beacon is an item only and is remade when influence moves a whole percent,
so ships undo the old figures before taking the new ones.

New incursion option Penalties (default true).

Percent modifiers on an attribute an item doesn't have, with a default of
0, are now skipped like multipliers, so a smartbomb no longer gains 0
values for its other damage types.
